            "If read returns msg_length (full buffer), buf[read_ret] = buf[msg_length] is accessed at 0x1458",
            "Check: if buf[msg_length] == '\\n' (0x0a), write buf[msg_length] = 0x00 at 0x146c — this is one byte past the allocation"
          ]
